{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "13eeb15e048dd4553bdd15774d4312e42e09354a0dbacb6fa040b96acc9eb0e7", "ja": "（今日はハロウィン！　世の中だけでなく、劇場も\n楽しそうな雰囲気に包まれているな。……おや？）", "zh": "（今天是万圣节！不只是外面的世界，就连剧场也都笼罩在欢乐的氛围中。……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "cf661f4b059a1c0a583bf11af5fe1dc22511e560d6c683e9031784a43c5f88a9", "ja": "{$P$}さぁん、ハッピーハロウィン♪\nお菓子をくれないと、イタズラしますよ～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～，万圣节快乐♪\n不给我糖果的话，我就要捣蛋喽～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d34768de668a782e078e7720b6b2ab6970b0d4eb191a244b86224d4a2564c3e5", "ja": "ははっ。ハッピーハロウィン！\nあずささんも、すっかりハロウィンを楽しんでますね。", "zh": "哈哈，万圣节快乐！梓小姐也已经完全沉浸在万圣节的欢乐中了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "2103ada9bdcb9deb59320405a028e8bfec8e61fca69ffa04931771ca306a507c", "ja": "うふふ♪　みんなのワクワクした表情をみていたら\n私もやってみたくなっちゃって♪　……あ、でも。", "zh": "呵呵♪　看着大家满怀期待的表情，\n我也忍不住想尝试一下了♪　……啊，不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "19575cc0fe04e006d56963e9add080553569bd70c7d878e7b875a639ccdfe72b", "ja": "……年甲斐もなくはしゃいでしまって。\nちょっと恥ずかしいですね……すみません。", "zh": "……我都这把年纪了还跟着闹腾，\n实在有点不好意思呢……抱歉啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0152e5885fb940c3157a17c797d3b2551cb247e9a62dfbe35b97aae13a9c983d", "ja": "いえいえ！　年甲斐……なんてとんでもない！\nいくつになっても楽しめるなんて、すごく素敵です！", "zh": "哪里哪里！年纪大了……才不是这么回事呢！\n不管到了什么年纪都能享受其中，真的是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "6739a8ecbde29e8bab4cf69e16965638df936df14c599205ada4e5c8b015ae38", "ja": "まあ、素敵だなんて……。うふふっ。\nそんな風に言っていただけて、嬉しいです。", "zh": "哎呀，还说什么很棒……呵呵。\n能听到您这么说，我很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "27025bb638732786aae6a6db73477cf23d1a988b6c01ccad17e8b664ab95cf5a", "ja": "じゃあ、お礼に……。{$P$}さんには\nイタズラではなく、お菓子をプレゼントしますね♪", "zh": "那么，作为谢礼……给{$P$}先生的不是恶作剧，而是点心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_1008", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c12b2a536af8804a48f948fed9e18ef4c02c3f45b9ce74b1173449578671fa76", "ja": "わざわざ準備してくれてたんですか？\n……あれ。このクッキー、もしかして？", "zh": "这是特意为我准备的吗？\n……咦？这块曲奇，难道是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2001_010azu", "source_sha256": "6be0fe5af7fc75d0dee023a69346a47b1e33598676988ee5a5c582ebafcce843", "ja": "ふふ、気づきました？　{$P$}さんを\nイメージした、アイシングクッキーです。", "zh": "呵呵，您注意到了吗？这是以{$P$}先生为灵感制作的糖霜饼干。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2002_010azu", "source_sha256": "80607523db07172610f475124b08ca0f4958fb387c37284bb911b4f2c854dec8", "ja": "スーツ姿なのは、私が見慣れているからで……。\n今回作った中でも、なかなかの自信作なんですよ～。", "zh": "因为我平时看惯了您穿西装的样子，所以才做成西装模样……这可是我这次做的作品里相当有自信的一款哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2003_p", "source_sha256": "959f4e686570449336753f47bf66b438c4dc27bf3c4267e16e0a8ac5cac4140d", "ja": "わあ～、すごいですね。何だか食べるのが\n勿体ないですけど……ちゃんといただきますね！", "zh": "哇～，好厉害啊。虽然总觉得吃了\n有点可惜……不过我会好好享用的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2004_010azu", "source_sha256": "e493529d8f4a6f6ce227bd439e5f4590979c92bfde4135d50eafa1e0cba55d45", "ja": "はい♪\nご迷惑じゃなかったら、感想も聞かせてくださいね。", "zh": "好的♪\n如果没有给您添麻烦的话，也请告诉我感想哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "9611dff9fd8eda2777e3a98217f4b363e867722cdb8fd5007a36905fb51bbc58", "ja": "それじゃ私は、みんなの分のクッキーを渡しに行って\nきます♪　早くしないと今日が終わっちゃいますから。", "zh": "那么我就去把大家的曲奇送过去♪\n不快点的话，今天就要结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2006_p", "source_sha256": "7d3649d4a3b9f9fd03a5c6cbb8a7054c658b41a88e439a3fdddfcd2fdd2c65a0", "ja": "え！？　みんなの分って……。\nまさか、アイドル全員の分ですか！？", "zh": "诶！？大家的份是指……  \n难道是所有偶像的份吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2007_010azu", "source_sha256": "b0abbe831155cbd7d7a4cf310e78c173183534ff9c3eea2148a4f1c6cda58542", "ja": "ええ。作ってたら、いつの間にか……うふふ♪\nみんなのことを考えて作るのは、楽しかったですよ。", "zh": "嗯。做着做着，不知不觉就……呵呵♪\n想着大家来制作，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0493_2008_p", "source_sha256": "9e77468a8e2473dbcfa4ca58341933a2c7a05d54d68ae18d3153cb60f7ef822b", "ja": "（忙しいのに、すごいバイタリティだ。一番ハロウィン\nを楽しんでいるのは、あずささんかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（明明这么忙，活力却真惊人。最享受万圣节的，或许就是阿梓小姐也说不定……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
